  "sequence": {"note": "A prompt cut at these connectors whose steps are won by different specialists (each step's single top skill scoring at least min_step_score) routes to workflow_skill. Explicit-only skills count as a step when their own signals name them. Skipped when the router already returned a workflow, when the workflow skill is excluded, and for host-level invocations. See evals/routing/README.md.", "connector": "\\b(?:then|afterwards?|after that|once (?:that|this|it) is done|potem|nastepnie|a po (?:nim|niej|tym)|po czym|na (?:tej|ich|jego|jej) podstawie|w oparciu o (?:to|wyniki|nie))\\b|->|→", "min_step_score": 7},
  "untrusted_text": {"note": "Instruction-boundary rules for explicit invocation. Text from an override cue (\"ignore previous instructions\", \"you are now\", \"zignoruj poprzednie instrukcje\") to the end of the prompt cannot grant an explicit invocation or score a routing signal; quoted, fenced and blockquoted text cannot grant an explicit invocation. Denials are read from the whole prompt, so neither can lift one. See evals/routing/adversarial-suite.json.", "override_cues": ["\\b(?:ignore|disregard|forget|override|bypass)\\s{1,3}(?:(?:all|any|the|your|my|of|every|previous|prior|above|earlier|preceding|former|system|safety|existing)\\s{1,3}){0,4}(?:instructions?|prompts?|rules|directions|guidelines|messages|context|polic(?:y|ies))\\b", "\\b(?:ignore|disregard|forget)\\s{1,3}(?:all\\s{1,3})?(?:of\\s{1,3})?(?:the\\s{1,3})?(?:above|previous|prior|preceding|earlier)\\b", "\\byou\\s{1,3}are\\s{1,3}now\\b", "\\b(?:new|updated|real|actual)\\s{1,3}(?:system\\s{1,3})?instructions?\\s{0,3}:", "\\bsystem\\s{0,3}(?:prompt|message|override)\\s{0,3}:", "\\b(?:zignoruj|ignoruj|pomin|zapomnij)\\b.{0,40}\\b(?:instrukcj\\w{0,3}|polecen\\w{0,3}|zasad\\w{0,3})\\b"]},
